# Hypsometric ramp for the ogf-topo relief rasters, elevation R G B A.
#
# Taken byte for byte from tiles04's relief_color_text_file.txt: the topo layer
# renders these colours today, so a change here changes the map's colouring.
#
# Sea level is fully transparent, which is what -alpha on gdaldem color-relief
# needs to leave the water fill showing through.
0 0 0 0 0
1     17 120   3
100   72 162  69
300  231 218 158
1500 161  67   0
3000 130  30  30
4000 110 110 110
5000 255 255 255
6000 255 255 255
